# MedAgent — Cursor rules. These constraints are LOCKED. Do not deviate.

## Backend
- LLM calls go through the Groq Python client ONLY. NEVER use OpenAI or Anthropic clients/SDKs at runtime.
- Models: Llama 3.3 70B for orchestration, synthesis, and the LLM judge. Llama 3.1 8B for cheap tasks (query rewriting, classification). Confirm exact Groq model IDs against Groq's docs.
- Embeddings: sentence-transformers all-MiniLM-L6-v2, run LOCALLY. NEVER OpenAI embeddings.
- Vector DB: ChromaDB persistent client at ./chroma_db/. NEVER Pinecone or hosted vector DBs.
- Keyword search: rank-bm25. Hybrid retrieval = dense + BM25 fused via Reciprocal Rank Fusion.
- Orchestration: LangGraph. Verify against the current official quickstart; the API changed in 2024-2025.
- API: FastAPI with SSE streaming. Same app serves the frontend as static files (StaticFiles mount).
- PubMed: NCBI Entrez via Biopython. Drug data: local SQLite.
- Secrets: load from .env via python-dotenv. NEVER hardcode keys.

## Frontend
- Vanilla HTML5 + JavaScript + Alpine.js (CDN) + Tailwind CSS (CDN).
- NO React, NO Vue, NO npm, NO build step. CDN script tags only.
- Streaming via fetch + ReadableStream. Dark mode default. Served by FastAPI, not a separate server.

## Architecture
src/data, src/retrieval, src/agents, src/orchestrator, src/guards, src/generation, src/api, src/cli.py, frontend/static, tests/

## Scope — do NOT expand
- 2 agents only: PubMed RAG + Drug Interaction SQL. NO web search agent.
- 3 guard layers: heuristic retry, token overlap, LLM-as-judge. NO numeric guard.
- Deploy target: HuggingFace Spaces, Docker SDK, port 7860, host 0.0.0.0.